{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 161379, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 107807, "uid": 81618, "type": 4, "title": "增伤技能详解，看懂这篇你就会配队", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1656993564, "updated_at": 1657629657, "updated_uid": 81618, "comment_at": 1668082774, "last_at": 1676077318, "comment_count": 14, "status": 1, "summary": "施工中。。。标题起得烂，根本没人看。大家在进行PvE活动时要先组队，我们会看到巨佬们的队伍都差不多，那是因为巨佬们的角色齐全，练度顶尖，他们的牌面都差不多，所以队伍也差不多。在抄作业时，如果不知道选用", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_793/h_609/1069/81618/2022/6/5/718036.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_793/h_609/1069/81618/2022/6/5/217894.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 7, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 9287, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 7, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 161379, "content": "<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br><div>施工中。。。标题起得烂，根本没人看。</div></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div><br></div><div>大家在进行PvE活动时要先组队，我们会看到巨佬们的队伍都差不多，那是因为巨佬们的角色齐全，练度顶尖，他们的牌面都差不多，所以队伍也差不多。在抄作业时，如果不知道选用Child的原因，难免会抄得稀里糊涂。这个词条，从增伤技能的方面入手，详细解释了各Buff/Debuff对伤害的影响，再配合对持续时间、加速和刷新的了解，应该就能对配队有更加深入的认识。</div><div><br></div><div>游戏中有各种各样的增伤技能，如果只知道它们可以增伤，却不了解它们到底能增加多少，那么在配队时就会纠结。这些内容在<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/86419.html\" target=\"_blank\">伤害公式</a>词条中也有，但那个词条写得比较复杂，以至于太长不看。在这里，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">我<span style=\"\">把公式简化，忽略了敏捷暴击加成、无视防御伤害和追加伤害，只考虑在弱点攻击的情况</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></span>，希望能更容易理解一些。</div></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">简化版固伤技能伤害公式</div></div><br></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">忽略敏暴加成、无视防御和追加伤害</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">技能的</span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">单发</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">伤害 = (技能攻击力×</span><span style=\"color: rgb(49, 133, 155);\">技能攻击力倍数&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">+&nbsp;面板白攻</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">×<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">攻击力倍数</span>×<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">攻击力窃取</span>×技能系数×</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">技能红攻倍数</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">) × (</span><span style=\"color: rgb(249, 182, 71);\">弱点<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">系数</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">+</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">暴击</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">系数) ×&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">伤害比例</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">×&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(118, 146, 60);\">伤害量倍数</span></div></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div></div></span><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">简化版百分比技能伤害公式</div></div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">忽略敏暴加成、无视防御和追加伤害</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(64,64,64);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">技能的</span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">单发</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">伤害 =&nbsp;面板白攻</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">×<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">攻击力倍数</span>×<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">攻击力窃取</span>×技能系数×</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">技能红攻倍数</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"></span>×技能百分比×<span style=\"color: rgb(49, 133, 155);\">技能攻击力倍数&nbsp;</span>× (<span style=\"color: rgb(249, 182, 71);\">弱点<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">系数</span></span>+<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">暴击</span>系数) ×&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">伤害比例</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">×&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(118, 146, 60);\">伤害量倍数</span></div></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div></div></span><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">参数解释</div></div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">面板白攻</span>：Child面板上的白攻，包括自身的、温泉的、装备的和生效中的魂卡特效和附魔提供的。</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">技能攻击力</span>：游戏中不可见，只与技能等级和点火升变有关，大多数Child的都差不多。一般来说70级的N技能攻击力1000多，<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">70级</span>的S技能攻击力3000多。百分比技能的<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">技能攻击力通常为0，但固定值的<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(49,133,155);font-size:14px;\">技能攻击力</span>UP（如三星达比的队长技）对<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">百分比技能</span>也有增伤。</span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">技能百分比</span></span>：百分比技能面板上的那个百分比数字。</span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(49, 133, 155); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">技能攻击力倍数</span></span>：百分比形式的<span style=\"color: rgb(49, 133, 155); font-size: 14px;\">技能攻击力</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">UP之和 + 1</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">攻击力倍数</span></span>：各种形式的增加<span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);font-size:14px;\">攻击力</span>的Buff之和 + 1</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">攻击力窃取</span></span>：撒拉修独有的技能，技能数值 + 1</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">技能系数</span></span>：固定的数值。<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">技能红攻倍数</span></span>：红攻增伤的比例 + 1</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(249,182,71);font-size:14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(249, 182, 71);\">弱点</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">系数</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"></span>：<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">弱点取</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">1.4</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">，正常取</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">，强属性取</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">0.7。</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">暴击</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">系数</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(64,64,64);\"></span>：<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">暴击取</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">1</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">，不暴击取</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">0。</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,240);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">伤害比例</span></span>：红防和白防对伤害有影响，红、白防都为0时，这个比例为100%。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(118,146,60);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">伤害量倍数</span></span>：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">各种形式的增加</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,176,80);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(118,146,60);font-size:14px;\">伤害量</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">的Buff<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">/Debuff</span>之和 + 1</span></span></span></div><div></div></span><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">增伤技能分类</div></div><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">攻击力类</span>：包括<img data-width=\"111\" data-height=\"111\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/5/887238.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/5/887238.png\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\">攻击力UP，<img data-width=\"111\" data-height=\"111\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/7/297973.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/7/297973.png\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\">蓄力、双刃剑、狂暴化、应援中的加攻击力、痛苦升华、图鉴Buff的加攻击力等。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">技能攻击力类</span>：包括<img data-width=\"111\" data-height=\"111\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/5/16706.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/5/16706.png\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\">技能攻击力UP、Slide技能攻击力UP等。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">伤害量类</span>：包括<img data-width=\"111\" data-height=\"111\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/5/330277.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/5/330277.png\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\">技能伤害量UP、Normal技能伤害量UP、<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">Slide技能伤害量UP<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"\">（这三个Buff的图标和技能攻击力的几乎一样）</span></span>、觉醒、暴击伤害量UP、弱点伤害量UP、<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">应援中的加<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">弱点伤害</span></span>等，以及</span><img data-width=\"111\" data-height=\"111\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/7/620435.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/7/620435.png\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\">技能防御DOWN、Slide技能防御DOWN、暴击伤害防御DOWN、弱点防御DOWN、增殖等。红敏、红暴的增伤也属于此类。另外，目标身上的技<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">能防御UP<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">（非次数型）</span>、Slide技能防御UP、暴击伤害防御UP、弱点防御UP等属于伤害量类的减伤效果。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">应援</span>：<img data-width=\"111\" data-height=\"111\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/5/112748.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/5/112748.png\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\">含有<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">加攻击力</span>和加<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">弱点伤害两种效果，分别属于攻击力类和伤害量类。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">攻击力窃取</span>：<img data-width=\"111\" data-height=\"111\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/5/734973.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/5/734973.png\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\">萨拉修独有的技能。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">护甲穿透</span>：<img data-width=\"111\" data-height=\"111\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/5/319317.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/5/319317.png\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\">水罗刹独有的技能，按<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">目标白防的最终值</span>来减少防御。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">破防类</span>：包括<img data-width=\"111\" data-height=\"111\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/5/534534.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/5/534534.png\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\">防御力DOWN和<img data-width=\"111\" data-height=\"111\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/5/352377.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_111/h_111/1069/81618/2022/6/5/352377.png\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\">剑刃舞，按<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">目标白防的面板值</span>来减少防御。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">以上Buff和Debuff，完全相同的会互相覆盖，按照&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">高</span>DS-&gt;SS-&gt;NS<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">低</span>&nbsp;的优先级，由高的技能产生的<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Buff/Debuff会覆盖低<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">的技能产生的。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">同类别的<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Buff/Debuff效果数值相加。</span></span></span></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">公式解释</div></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"></div></span></span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\">在目前版本中，Boss战用的攻击型Child，除了水罗刹其他都推荐百分比刀，那就先以百分比技能伤害公式为例。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">简化后的百分比技能伤害公式中，各因子都是乘积的关系，把某个因子扩大多少倍，伤害就会变成多少倍。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">例如萨拉修N技能的<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">攻击力窃取，+6两火后，技能数值达到81.2%。也就是说，挂上了<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">攻击力窃取时的伤害，是没挂上时的1.8倍多。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">接着来看伤害量类，这一类的Buff/Debuff很多，而同类是加算。比如在Raid中，身上已有80%的技能伤害量UP和120%的弱点伤害量UP的情况下，再加上一个20%的伤害量，这个新增的效果使伤害变为 (1 + 80% + 120% + 20%) / (<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1 + 80% + 120%</span>) = 1.067倍，不多，就像是增伤效果被同类Buff给“</span></span></span>稀释”了，这也解释了红敏红暴的增伤效果为什么不行。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">再来看破防类，红、白防决定了伤害比例<span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（注：追加伤害不受防御影响）</span></span>，红、白防全为0时，伤害比例是100%<span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（详见附录1）</span></span>。在WB中，Boss的白防通常在5200左右，没有红防，可能会有10%或20%的防御力UP。在Raid中，Boss的白防通常是2329，没有红防，一般会有200%的防御力UP。在RB中，Boss的白防通常在1400上下，没有红防，一般会有100%的防御力UP（具体数据详见<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/151227.html\" target=\"_blank\">Boss属性</a>词条），而破防技能的百分比是作用在基础白防上的。举个例子，在WB中，Boss如果没有防御力UP，那么90%的减防使Boss的白防变为 5200 - 5200<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">×<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">90% = 520，达到0需要100%的减防；如果Boss有20%的防御力UP，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">那么90%的减防使Boss的白防变为 5200<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">×(1 + 20%)</span> - 5200</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">×<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">90% = 1560，达到0就需要120%的减防。由此可见，在WB中破防很重要，100%的减防大约可以使伤害变为5倍；<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">在RB中也许有用，95%</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">的减防大约可以使伤害变为1.5倍；<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">在Raid中用处不大，95%</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">的减防大约可以使伤害变为1.33倍。</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">水罗刹独有的穿甲是在目标的最终白防上计算的，升满后有74.8%，可以使RaidBoss的白防变为 2329</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"\">×(1 + 200%)<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">×<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(1 - 74.8%) = 1761。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">特别说明</span>，技能防御DOWN、弱点防御DOWN等属于伤害量Buff类。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></span></span></div></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></span></div></span></span></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">。。。 。。。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">附录</div></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">1、<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">NS和SS在不同红、白防下的伤害比例：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"793\" data-height=\"609\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_793/h_609/1069/81618/2022/6/5/718036.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_793/h_609/1069/81618/2022/6/5/718036.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"793\" data-height=\"609\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_793/h_609/1069/81618/2022/6/5/217894.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_793/h_609/1069/81618/2022/6/5/217894.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></span></span></span><div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_793/h_609/1069/81618/2022/6/5/718036.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_793/h_609/1069/81618/2022/6/5/217894.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 81618, "username": "lyzzzk", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/1.png", "description": "个性签名", "follow